r print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zsBKoFEAQfkQ7kNvwFyou_N&_nc_oc=AdpmdGLAd_P-yNeSvtz0bXWj82yFKo_p_ryffeU7GRGXpNvC8nX5s05dmi7SWlTUKdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af20ME7HjnWzF3Ka8jB8tDpG8i_G4nz14AqJVboIVUGiqg&oe=69D5176E"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CYp769r8RPIQ7kNvwHxwJ6R&_nc_oc=Adp7r_m7Sak_HQ7_gg4RdiSQBlnh0G78fXv8_FfE_7wOuW4D1fzMsl--nqe-Fs0IKhY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1zz_a6NQX2YVxhaTZm9Bdu1Q1pQelzukTjulUDxzS8Ig&oe=69D4F0EF"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QuFb8lHvY1cQ7kNvwF683me&_nc_oc=AdpfzkgMDG2AjDa9EvLjZllUaPWE9qzAeTQyQfiW2pL7wtWVF8ALvpDH-AGRX62ARpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1TL1IUFreRWvEQRtmEGh28MriYIUzMWSBn1I94nDf2kQ&oe=69D4E3D7"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IRBwJSkYC4EQ7kNvwE-JA3K&_nc_oc=AdrzNrK-0nKST0Uj-FdxpV-6mqmeeHDrPy_aSLMSriaENwrKbA9pq_2mODQ7cusLk3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1CJvl-_EfaU_JcZVpgrjyqbIA4tcGfW-Za-fnISCSjcg&oe=69D4ED91"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qiOCGNChLpUQ7kNvwEQblWe&_nc_oc=AdoybY2tn6GzWZ5e51MAEMMDR_bF1LxmDggenRjbcUPQPU55OCqdFB2SLO4xP_FuQxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1lYYIWEPxwMXfZ8aa5Z2MeZUopsDBzEdvnZZH6LHXA_g&oe=69D4F33C"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "ex